    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a casual game that operates on desktops. It lets you watch girls dancing when you are working on computers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/eba347a392d7d1947d05e0b427ec27b5.poster.avif?t=1741190046\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/eba347a392d7d1947d05e0b427ec27b5.webm?t=1741190046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/eba347a392d7d1947d05e0b427ec27b5.mp4?t=1741190046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the \u201cPlus\u201d button, then you can see the configure menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/e41deeb396e8816abf0333e65984d617.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling up the character as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/c74c4f2833eea89fe54f34e3a467cb4c.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/6110d8ddce6ad3c863f114cd005325b6.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the \u201cheart\u201d for unlocking clothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/c1145141d9e39be19d4e9b3bd1c16e84.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and hold to drag position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/3b0a8cfe31b4df44c1b3eabf59a13b2c.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance switching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/79b6d2188119b4856cca2c161e1a6739.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click \u201cALERT\u201d button in case of \u201cEmergence\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504940/extras/6dc60660d8d174115d96ec782ac2fe47.avif?t=1741190046\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
